<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="KR5c0139-ann"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Annotations for 南華真經註疏</title></titleStmt><publicationStmt><p>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</p></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><p>Created by members of the TLS project</p></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation>Initially created: <date>2024-04-03T20:40:37.801+09:00</date> by CH</creation><textClass><catRef scheme="#tls-dates" target="#notav"/></textClass></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Annotations</head><p xml:id="KR5c0139-start"><seg xml:id="KR5c0139_tls_000-002ps.2"><line>故未始藏其狂言</line><tls:ann xmlns:tls="http://hxwd.org/ns/1.0" concept="NEVER" concept-id="uuid-77f765a8-fb37-4e34-94e1-7e10c2e3aea6" xml:id="uuid-86049d4a-b8dd-4e0f-849d-4ab8dd3e0fe5"><link target="#KR5c0139_tls_000-002ps.2 #uuid-bc263db5-127b-4b2f-a63d-b5127bcb2fd2"/><tls:text><tls:srcline title="南華真經註疏" target="#KR5c0139_tls_000-002ps.2" pos="undefined">故未始藏其狂言</tls:srcline><tls:line title="Translation of 南華真經註疏 into (English)" transl-id="KR5c0139-en-557206b5" src="Richard Lynn">As such, he never kept wild talk about it to himself.</tls:line></tls:text><form corresp="#uuid-99fdbd59-79b0-4ed6-8aa8-abe2e7717145 #uuid-a148ce2d-fb75-42e9-844f-b9cea352ffdd" orig=""><orth>未始</orth><pron xml:lang="zh-Latn-x-pinyin">wèi shǐ</pron></form><sense corresp="#uuid-bc263db5-127b-4b2f-a63d-b5127bcb2fd2"><gramGrp><pos>V</pos><tls:syn-func corresp="#uuid-819e81af-c978-4931-8fd2-52680e097f01">VPadV</tls:syn-func></gramGrp><def resp="#CH" updated="2022-08-07T19:04:25.569+09:00">not ever; never so far</def></sense><tls:metadata resp="#CH" created="2024-04-03T20:40:37.801+09:00"><respStmt><resp>added</resp><name notBefore="2024-04-03T20:40:37.801+09:00">CH</name></respStmt></tls:metadata></tls:ann></seg><seg xml:id="KR5c0139_tls_001-063cs.10"><line>而未始不逍遥也</line><tls:ann xmlns:tls="http://hxwd.org/ns/1.0" concept="NEVER" concept-id="uuid-77f765a8-fb37-4e34-94e1-7e10c2e3aea6" xml:id="uuid-02148e46-603b-4af5-948e-46603b4af57f"><link target="#KR5c0139_tls_001-063cs.10 #uuid-bc263db5-127b-4b2f-a63d-b5127bcb2fd2"/><tls:text><tls:srcline title="南華真經註疏" target="#KR5c0139_tls_001-063cs.10" pos="undefined">而未始不逍遥也</tls:srcline><tls:line title="Translation of 南華真經註疏 into (English)" transl-id="KR5c0139-en-557206b5" src="Richard Lynn">he never ceased exercising spontaneous freedom [xiaoyao].</tls:line></tls:text><form corresp="#uuid-99fdbd59-79b0-4ed6-8aa8-abe2e7717145 #uuid-a148ce2d-fb75-42e9-844f-b9cea352ffdd" orig=""><orth>未始</orth><pron xml:lang="zh-Latn-x-pinyin">wèi shǐ</pron></form><sense corresp="#uuid-bc263db5-127b-4b2f-a63d-b5127bcb2fd2"><gramGrp><pos>V</pos><tls:syn-func corresp="#uuid-819e81af-c978-4931-8fd2-52680e097f01">VPadV</tls:syn-func></gramGrp><def resp="#CH" updated="2022-08-07T19:04:25.569+09:00">not ever; never so far</def></sense><tls:metadata resp="#CH" created="2024-04-03T20:40:56.99+09:00"><respStmt><resp>added</resp><name notBefore="2024-04-03T20:40:56.99+09:00">CH</name></respStmt></tls:metadata></tls:ann></seg><seg xml:id="KR5c0139_tls_000-003cs.9.1.14.9"><line>古有殺青爲簡,</line><tls:ann xmlns:tls="http://hxwd.org/ns/1.0" concept="CUT" concept-id="uuid-8fc0e3c9-f12b-4c37-9254-34df515d6a17" xml:id="uuid-63236d54-03ac-4de0-a36d-5403ac1de0e8"><link target="#KR5c0139_tls_000-003cs.9.1.14.9 #uuid-f4bfb47b-c409-44a2-a48f-28d0d7441723"/><tls:text><tls:srcline title="南華真經註疏" target="#KR5c0139_tls_000-003cs.9.1.14.9" pos="1">古有殺青爲簡,</tls:srcline><tls:line title="Translation of 南華真經註疏 into (English)" transl-id="KR5c0139-en-2339bd49" src="TLS Project">In ancient times, green bamboo was scraped to make tablets,</tls:line></tls:text><form corresp="#uuid-42906930-31d1-4360-baa5-ed14eb90c285" orig=""><orth>殺</orth><pron xml:lang="zh-Latn-x-pinyin">shā</pron></form><sense corresp="#uuid-f4bfb47b-c409-44a2-a48f-28d0d7441723"><gramGrp>
                    <pos>V</pos>
  <tls:syn-func corresp="#uuid-fbfb2371-2537-4a99-a876-41b15ec2463c">vtoN</tls:syn-func>
                    <usg type="warring-states-currency">3</usg>
                </gramGrp><def>cut up, cut into convenient pieces</def></sense><tls:metadata resp="#chris" created="2025-04-25T11:22:30.453+09:00"><respStmt><resp>added</resp><name notBefore="2025-04-25T11:22:30.453+09:00">chris</name></respStmt></tls:metadata></tls:ann></seg><seg xml:id="KR5c0139_tls_000-003cs.9.1.14.10"><line>以韋爲編。</line><tls:ann xmlns:tls="http://hxwd.org/ns/1.0" concept="LEATHER" concept-id="uuid-f5ec67c7-9094-410c-a3fc-9514ba62816a" xml:id="uuid-0cbb3f5f-b28b-4c71-bb3f-5fb28b9c71bc"><link target="#KR5c0139_tls_000-003cs.9.1.14.10 #uuid-d7f2568f-928a-497d-b41d-077146dc1ee2"/><tls:text><tls:srcline title="南華真經註疏" target="#KR5c0139_tls_000-003cs.9.1.14.10" pos="2">以韋爲編。</tls:srcline><tls:line title="Translation of 南華真經註疏 into (English)" transl-id="KR5c0139-en-2339bd49" src="TLS Project">and leather was used for binding.</tls:line></tls:text><form corresp="#uuid-87978119-8108-4f7e-993d-c8447a7db34f" orig=""><orth>韋</orth><pron xml:lang="zh-Latn-x-pinyin">wéi</pron></form><sense corresp="#uuid-d7f2568f-928a-497d-b41d-077146dc1ee2"><gramGrp>
                    <pos>N</pos>
  <tls:syn-func corresp="#uuid-b6da65fd-429f-4245-9f94-a22078cc0512">ncc</tls:syn-func>
